# Backend Architecture

## Layers
- Domain: entities, value-objects, repository interfaces
  - [backend/src/domain/entities](mdc:backend/src/domain/entities)
  - [backend/src/domain/value-objects](mdc:backend/src/domain/value-objects)
  - [backend/src/domain/repositories](mdc:backend/src/domain/repositories)
- Application: use-cases and DTOs
  - [backend/src/application/use-cases](mdc:backend/src/application/use-cases)
  - [backend/src/application/dtos](mdc:backend/src/application/dtos)
- Infrastructure: Prisma repositories and external services
  - [backend/src/infrastructure/repositories](mdc:backend/src/infrastructure/repositories)
- Presentation: controllers and routes
  - [backend/src/presentation/controllers](mdc:backend/src/presentation/controllers)
  - [backend/src/presentation/routes](mdc:backend/src/presentation/routes)

## Rules
- Domain is independent of application/infrastructure.
- Use-cases orchestrate logic; controllers perform validation and mapping only.
- All DB access goes through repository implementations in infrastructure.
- Input/output use DTOs; validate with validators (e.g., [backend/src/application/validators](mdc:backend/src/application/validators)).

## Prisma
- Schema at [backend/prisma/schema.prisma](mdc:backend/prisma/schema.prisma)
- Migrations in [backend/prisma/migrations](mdc:backend/prisma/migrations)

## Testing
- Unit: domain and application under [backend/src/tests/domain](mdc:backend/src/tests/domain)
- Integration: repositories/services under [backend/src/tests/integration](mdc:backend/src/tests/integration)
- E2E: HTTP routes under [backend/src/tests/e2e](mdc:backend/src/tests/e2e)
  - Test DB setup in [backend/src/tests/database](mdc:backend/src/tests/database)

